{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Mito, a sandbox adventure game where you explore a randomly generated world to gather eight keys and defeat an ancient evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a random world, acquire items and spend skill points to prepare yourself for a historic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world: As you walk the world is built around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full physics simulation: Every item or object is simulated! Furniture is not just a tile in a grid, it rolls and tumbles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible terrain: Build or destroy with high precision!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the get go with mouse or gamepad controls: Play however you prefer with no compromises!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680570?t=1768509965","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/fba20e253589ba84160c7281d5141f0bb5a9ab89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768509965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/bc2c490f13654d98236c225cf54e73135f8dbbee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768509965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680570/bc2c490f13654d98236c225cf54e73135f8dbbee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768509965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Mito, a sandbox adventure game where you explore a randomly generated world to gather eight keys and defeat an ancient evil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas